4744b14f3817867644d63cee3","tree_id":"70364ab550c51eaffa19781d533a4e129ee16df6","message":"Wire sharding-aware Muon optimizer and NamedSharding into training.\n\n- Integrates sharding-aware Muon optimizer supporting Newton-Schulz iterations and partition padding into MaxText.\n- Fixes weight dimension indexing in muon_utils.py to account for layer scanning, 1D tensor exclusions, and rank-aware 2D attention projection handling.\n- Fixes routing gate exclusion logic to use exact segment matching across gate and router variants.\n- Plumbs NamedSharding in sharding.py by collecting momentum trees across multi-branch partitioned optimizers, extracting MuonState NamedTuples, and filtering optax.MaskedNode placeholders.\n- Threads mesh through train_utils.py, train_compile.py, and maxtext_engine.py to get_optimizer.\n- Add some minor tests throughout.\n\nPiperOrigin-RevId: 969931330","timestamp":"2026-08-24T20:12:56Z","author":{"name":"Zachary Charles","email":"zachcharles@google.com"},"committer":{"name":"maxtext authors","email":"google-ml-automation@google.com"}},"repository":{"id":607845880,"node_id":"R_kgDOJDr9-A","name":"maxtext","full_name":"AI-Hypercomputer/maxtext","private":false,"owner":{"login":"AI-Hypercomputer","id":181000646,"node_id":"O_kgDOCsnZxg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181000646?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AI-Hypercomputer","html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Hypercomputer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AI-Hypercomputer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AI-Hypercomputer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AI-Hypercomputer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AI-Hypercomputer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AI-Hypercomputer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AI-Hypercomputer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AI-Hypercomput